2 CONT *'''Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino (1)
2 CONT *'''M, #113660, b. 9 September 1492, d. 4 May 1519
2 CONT *Last Edited=4 Jun 2010
2 CONT *'''     Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino was born on 9 September 1492. He was the son of Piero II de Medici and Alfonsina Orsini. He married Madeleine de la Tour, daughter of Jean III de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne and Jeanne d
2 CONC e Bourbon, on 2 May 1518. A contract for the marriage of Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino and Madeleine de la Tour was signed on 16 January 1517/18.3 He died on 4 May 1519 at age 26.
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of Duca di Urbino.1 He held the office of Governor of Florence in 1513.4
2 CONT *'''Child of Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino and Madeleine de la Tour
2 CONT **1. Catherine de Medici+ (1) b. 13 Apr 1519, d. 5 Jan 1589
