2 CONT
2 CONT Alfonso I d'Este, Duca di Ferrara was the son of Ercole I d'Este, Duca di Ferrara. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lucrezia Borgia, daughter of Rodrigo Borgia and Vannozza dei Cattanei. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1534. (19
2 CONT
