1 TITL cardinal
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/napoleone-orsini_(Dizionario-Biografico)/
2 CONT ------
2 CONT * http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Napoleone_Orsini_Frangipani
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Napoleone Orsini Frangipani''' (1263 – 24 March 1342) was a Roman Cardinal. His ecclesiastical career lasted 57 years, 54 of them as a cardinal, and included six conclaves. He was a member of the Orsini and Frangipani families.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Rome to Rinaldo Orsini, a brother of Pope Nicholas III, Napoleone took holy orders in 1285 and was named a papal sub-chaplain by Honorius IV. He rose quickly, and on 16 May 1288 was appointed cardinal deacon of San Adriano
2 CONC  by Nicholas IV.
2 CONT
2 CONT During the pontificate of Boniface VIII his gift for diplomacy was put to wide use and he was named legate to Spoleto and Ancona. In this capacity, in 1301, he retook the city of Gubbio, which had rebelled against the Papal State.
2 CONC  An opponent of the Colonna family, he was a supporter of Boniface' Italian crusades.
2 CONT
2 CONT During the Avignon Papacy Napoleone realigned himself with the Colonna and testified against Boniface at the latter's posthumous trial. Diplomatically active during the pontificates of Clement V and John XXII, he died at the age o
2 CONC f seventy-nine in 1342, at Avignon, during the reign of Benedict XII.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ...Dopo la sottomissione, https://www.geni.com/people/Giacomo-Colonna/6000000021426144926 risiedette a Marino, probabilmente presso il '''cardinale Napoleone Orsini''' (un suo parente, forse uno zio)... 
2 CONT *http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/colonna-giacomo-detto-sciarra_(Dizionario-Biografico)
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT ...https://www.geni.com/people/Giovanni-Colonna-marchese-di-Ancona/6000000015822126637?through=6000000014863212136 si sposò, in data non conosciuta, con una Orsini, probabilmente sorella del '''cardinale Napoleone'''... 
2 CONT *http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/giovanni-colonna_res-071038c7-87eb-11dc-8e9d-0016357eee51_(Dizionario-Biografico)/
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
