2 CONT
2 CONT but the wife https://www.geni.com/people/Elena-Salviati/6000000008970637380 is c.1495-1552,  her mother born 1470
2 CONT
2 CONT /!\ so this is NOT https://www.geni.com/people/Pallavicino-marchese-di-Busseto/6000000015330705167 (1426-1486) his son had the feud of Castel San Giovanni.  
