2 CONT *'''     Catherine d' Medici was born on 13 April 1519 at Florence, Italy.1 She married Henri II d' Orleans, King of France, Duke of Brittany & Orleans''', son of François I d' Orleans, King of France, Duke de Valois & Bretagne an
