2 CONT *'''    Catherine de Medici was born on 13 April 1519.1 She was the daughter''' of Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino and Madeleine de la Tour.4 '''She married Henri II, Roi de France''', son of François I, Roi de France and Cla
2 CONC ude de Valois, Duchesse de Bretagne, '''on 28 October 1533.1 She died on 5 January 1589 at age 69.
2 CONT *'''     She gained the title of Comtesse de Lauraguais.1 She gained the title of Comtesse d'Auvergne.1
