2 CONT '''Galeazzo I Visconti''' (21 January 1277 – 6 August 1328) was lord of Milan from 1322 to 1327. After being chosen Captain of Milan, he defeated two papal armies and was excommunicated by Pope John XXII. Temporarily imprisoned fo
2 CONC r murder, Galeazzo retired to Pescia and died in August 1328. .. ...
