2 CONT
2 CONT Cesare II Gonzaga (Mantua, 1592 – February 26, 1632) was Duke of Guastalla.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Ferrante II Gonzaga, Duke of Guastalla and Duke of Amalfi and of Vittoria Doria.
2 CONT  He succeeded his father in 1630, but died 2 years later.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married in 1612 with Isabella Orsini (1598–1623),and had 2 children :
2 CONT
2 CONT  Ferrante III Gonzaga (1618–1678), next Duke of Guastalla.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Vespasiano Vincenzo Gonzaga, (1621–1687), Viceroy of Valencia, married María Inés Manrique de Lara, daughter and heiress of Manuel 9th Count of Prades de Nava
