1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://hr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernardin_Frankopan
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernardin Frankopan (*1453 - †1529.), hrvatski velikaš, vojskovođa, diplomat i mecena, pripadnik roda knezova Frankopana. Kao moćan i ugledan aristokrat, bio je nositelj borbe za opstanak hrvatskog naroda na prostorima ugroženima 
2 CONC od turske invazije.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1490 emlitve
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogy.euweb.cz/balkan/frangep2.html#BB
2 CONT
2 CONT Duimo (Duym) II Frangepán, Ct of Veglia, fl 1280-1316; m.Ursa N (de Vodiča = Babonic = Blagay) (+before 16.10.1343); They had issue: 
2 CONT *A1. Frigyes IV, Ct of Veglia, Vindol, Modrus and Gačka, fl 1306-22; m.before 1313 Erzsébet N (+after 1315) 
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT **B2. Bertalan V, Ct of Veglia and Modrus, Somogyi főispán (obergespan of Somogy), fl 1334-61; m.NN, sister of Ulrich N 
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT ***C4. János V, Ct of Veglia and Modrus, Ban of Croatia and Dalmatia, +29.11.1393; m.23.5.1361 Anna von Görz (+5.9.1402) 
2 CONT ****D1. Miklós IV, Cte of Veglia, Zengg and Modrus, Ban of Croatia and Dalmatia, +26.6.1432; 1m: Dorottya Garai de Gara (fl 1409-24); 2m: Márta Újlaki (fl 1426-42), dau.of Imre Újlaki, Ban of Macso and Katalin N 
2 CONT ***** ... 
2 CONT *****E3. [1m.] István II (Stepko), Ct of Veglia and Modrus, Ban of Croatia, +1.3.1481; m.1446 Isotta d'Este (*1425 +1456) 
2 CONT ******F1. '''Bernardino (Bernát), Ct of Veglia and Modrus, +3.11.1527'''; m.before 16.9.1476 Donna Luisa Marzano d'Aragona 
2 CONT *******G1. Mátyás, fl 1495-1521; m.Zsófia Thúz de Lak (fl 1510-17), dau.of János Thúz de Lak, Ban of Slavonia 
2 CONT *******G2. Kristóf, Ct of Veglia, Zengg and Modrus, Ban of Croatia, +Martinac 22.9.1527; 1m: 1513 Apollonia Lang von Wellenburg (*1475/76, +Milano 4.2.1520), dau.of Hans Lang von Wellenburg and Margareta Sulzer; 2m: Anna Drágffy d
2 CONC e Béltek (fl 1522-27), dau.of Bertalan Drágffy de Béltek and Dorottya Héderváry de Hédervár 
2 CONT *******G3. Ferdinand, +ca 1527; m.before 1509 Marija Brankovic (+1540) 
2 CONT ******** ...
2 CONT *******G4. Mária Magdolna, fl 1489, engaged to Mátyás Pongrácz de Dengeleg 
2 CONT *******G5. Isotta (Erzsébet), +13.9.1545; 1m: 22.1.1492 László Egerváry de Egervár et Velike (+before 1496); 2m: 5.9.1515 István Perényi de Nagyida (+1523/before 30.7.1525); 3m: 1528/33 Gf Gáspár Serédy de Seréd (+1.3.1550) 
2 CONT *******G6. Beatrix, *1480, +after 10.3.1510; 1m: 1496 János Corvinus Hunyadi, Pr of Hungary (*2.4.1473, +12.10.1504); 2m: Gyula 21.1./22.7.1509 Mkgf Georg von Brandenburg-Ansbach (*Ansbach 4.3.1484, +Ansbach 27.12.1543) 
2 CONT *******G7. János Ferenc, Archbishop of Kalocsa, +Pozsony 1543 
2 CONT *******(G8. Fruzsina; m.Ferenc Dessewffy de Csernek et Tarkeő) 
2 CONT *******(G9. Katalin, +after 1536; m.after 1502 Adam Svetokovic)
