0 @N6000000002322286006@ NOTE Piero, inheriting the mantle of family power from his father Lorenzo,
1 CONT alienated the people of Florence by siding with the French. Because of this
1 CONT act, considered a betrayal, the Medici had to flee Florence (1494). Brother
1 CONT Giovanni, then a cardinal, used his influence with Pope Julius II to bring
1 CONT the family back to the positions of power.
