0 @N6000000002322303971@ NOTE From 1496  would find Naples and Sicily ruled by viceroys for two centuries.
1 CONT The first of such was under control of Spain interested only in the use of
1 CONT the countries resources and gaining tax monies. In the first half of the 18th
