1 CONT the traditional Austrian holdings, securing the Netherlands by his own
1 CONT marriage, Hungary and Bohemia by treaty and military pressure, and Spain and
1 CONT the Spanish empire by the marriage of his son, Philip. He also fought a
1 CONT series of wars against the French, mostly in Italy. His grandson succeeded to
1 CONT this vast Habsburg realm and the imperial crown as Charles V.
